Bagian Kedua
PPT PKBGA
Pasal 15
(1) PPT PKBGA sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 14 huruf a dibentuk oleh Pemerintah Daerah sesuai dengan peraturan perundang undangan.
(2) Keanggotaan PPT PKBGA sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1) terdiri dari:
a. unsur Pemerintah Daerah;
b. instansi vertikal;
c. lembaga non pemerintah;
d. institusi pelayanan kesehatan;
e. aparat penegak hukum;
f. tenaga profesi;
g. relawan pendamping;
h. pekerja sosial;
i. rohaniwan;
j. pusat rehabilitasi sosial;
k. unsur Perguruan Tinggi.

translated_text:
Part Two
PPT PKBGA
Article 15
(1) PPT PKBGA as referred to in Article 14 letter a shall be established by the Regional Government in accordance with the laws and regulations.
(2) The membership of PPT PKBGA as referred to in paragraph (1) consists of:
a. elements of the Regional Government;
b. vertical agencies;
c. non-governmental institutions;
d. health service institutions;
e. law enforcement apparatus;
f. professional personnel;
g. companion volunteers;
h. social workers;
i. religious leaders;
j. social rehabilitation centers;
k. elements of Higher Education Institutions.

text:
Pasal 16
PPT PKBGA sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 14 huruf a mempunyai tugas:
a. mengupayakan pencegahan;
b. memberikan pelayanan pengaduan;
c. memberikan pelayanan kesehatan;
d. memberikan pelayanan rehabilitasi sosial;
e. memberikan pelayanan bantuan dan penegakan hukum; f. memberikan pelayanan pemulangan dan reintegrasi sosial; g. melakukan koordinasi dan kerjasama;
h. mengupayakan peningkatan partisipasi masyarakat;
i. melakukan monitoring dan pelaporan.

translated_text:
Article 16
PPT PKBGA as referred to in Article 14 letter a has the duties to:
a. undertake prevention;
b. provide complaint services;
c. provide health services;
d. provide social rehabilitation services;
e. provide assistance and law enforcement services; f. provide repatriation and social reintegration services; g. conduct coordination and cooperation;
h. undertake enhancement of community participation;
i. conduct monitoring and reporting.

text:
Pasal 18
Pelayanan Pengaduan sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 16, huruf b meliputi:
a. pelayanan pengaduan langsung;
b. pelayanan pengaduan melalui telepon;
c. pelayanan pengaduan melalui surat;
d. pelayanan pengaduan dari rujukan;
e. pelayanan penjangkauan korban.

translated_text:
Article 18
Complaint Services as referred to in Article 16, letter b include:
a. direct complaint services;
b. complaint services through telephone;
c. complaint services through mail;
d. complaint services from referrals;
e. victim outreach services.

text:
Pasal 19
Pelayanan Kesehatan sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 16, huruf c meliputi:
a. pelayanan medis;
b. pelayanan medis psikiatrik;
c. pelayanan medicolegal, meliputi: visum et repertum (VER), visum et psikiatrum dan identifikasi DNA.

translated_text:
Article 19
Health Services as referred to in Article 16, letter c include:
a. medical services;
b. psychiatric medical services;
c. medicolegal services, including: visum et repertum (VER), visum et psikiatrum and DNA identification.

text:
Pasal 20
Pelayanan Rehabilitasi Sosial sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 16, huruf d meliputi:
a. pelayanan konseling awal;
b. pelayanan konseling lanjutan;
c. penyediaan rumah aman;
d. pelayanan bimbingan rohani.

translated_text:
Article 20
Social Rehabilitation Services as referred to in Article 16, letter d include:
a. initial counseling services;
b. follow-up counseling services;
c. provision of safe houses;
d. spiritual guidance services.

text:
Pasal 21
Pelayanan Bantuan dan Penegakan Hukum sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 16, huruf e meliputi:
a. pelayanan bantuan hukum meliputi bantuan pendampingan hukum litigasi dan bantuan pendampingan hukum non litigasi;
b. pelayanan penegakan hukum meliputi penegakan hukum di tingkat Kepolisian, penegakan hukum di tingkat Kejaksaan dan penegakan hukum di tingkat Pengadilan;
c. pelayanan penegakan hukum di tingkat kepolisian sebagaimana dimaksud pada huruf b meliputi penegakan hukum pada proses Penyelidikan dan/atau peyidikan;
d. pelayanan penegakan hukum di tingkat Kejaksaan sebagaimana V—-dimaksud pada huruf b meliputi: penegakan hukum pada proses Pra Penuntutan dan Penuntutan;
e. pelayanan penegakan hukum di tingkat Pengadilan sebagimana dimaksud pada huruf b meliputi penegakan hukum pada tahap Pra Persidangan, Persidangan dan Penjatuhan Putusan.

translated_text:
Article 21
Services for Assistance and Law Enforcement as referred to in Article 16, letter e include:
a. legal assistance services include litigation legal assistance and support and non-litigation legal assistance and support;
b. law enforcement services include law enforcement at the Police level, law enforcement at the Prosecutor's Office level and law enforcement at the Court level;
c. law enforcement services at the police level as referred to in letter b include law enforcement in the Investigation and/or inquiry process;
d. law enforcement services at the Prosecutor's Office level as referred to in letter b include: law enforcement in the Pre-Prosecution and Prosecution process;
e. law enforcement services at the Court level as referred to in letter b include law enforcement at the Pre-Trial, Trial and Verdict stages.

text:
Pasal 22
(1) Pelayanan Pemulangan sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 16, huruf f meliputi:
a. pemulangan pekerja migran bermasalah;
b. pemulangan korban kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak; •\3 T
c. pemulangan korban tindak pidana perdagangan orang. (2) Pelayanan Reintegrasi Sosial sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 16, huruf f meliputi:
a. reintgrasi dengan keluarga;
b. reintegrasi dengan keluarga pengganti;
c. reintegrasi dengan lingkungan;
d. reintegrasi pendidikan.

translated_text:
Article 22
(1) Repatriation Services as referred to in Article 16, letter f include:
a. repatriation of migrant workers with problems;
b. repatriation of victims of gender-based violence and children; •\3 T
c. repatriation of victims of criminal acts of human trafficking. (2) Social Reintegration Services as referred to in Article 16, letter f include:
a. reintegration with family;
b. reintegration with substitute family;
c. reintegration with the environment;
d. educational reintegration.

text:
Pasal 24
Peningkatan partisipasi masyarakat sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 16, huruf h dilakukan dengan cara:
a. menumbuhkan kepedulian masyarakat terhadap kasus-kasus kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak;
b. mendorong masyarakat untuk berpartisipasi aktif dalam memberikan informasi dan melaporkan adanya kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak;
c. menumbuhkan kearifan lokal dalam penanganan kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak;
d. menyelenggarakan penguatan kelompok-kelompok masyarakat dalam penanganan kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak; e. menyebarluaskan informasi tentang peraturan perundang-undangan yang berkaitan dengan kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak.

translated_text:
Article 24
Increasing community participation as referred to in Article 16, letter h is carried out by means of:
a. fostering community awareness of cases of gender-based violence and violence against children;
b. encouraging the community to actively participate in providing information and reporting gender-based violence and violence against children;
c. fostering local wisdom in handling gender-based violence and violence against children;
d. organizing the strengthening of community groups in handling gender-based violence and violence against children; e. disseminating information about laws and regulations related to gender-based violence and violence against children.

text:
Bagian Ketiga
LPPTK
Pasal 28
(1) LPPTK sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 14 huruf b, dibentuk oleh Pemerintah Daerah sesuai dengan ketentuan peraturan perundang undangan.
(2) Pembentukan LPPTK sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat(l) keanggotaannya terdiri dari :
a. unsur Pemerintah Kecamatan;
b. unsur kepolisian kecamatan;
c. institusi pelayanan kesehatan;
d. tokoh masyarakat;
e. tokoh agama;
f. unsur organisasi kemasyarakatan.

translated_text:
Part Three
LPPTK
Article 28
(1) LPPTK as referred to in Article 14 letter b, is established by the Regional Government in accordance with the provisions of laws and regulations.
(2) The establishment of LPPTK as referred to in paragraph (1) consists of members from:
a. elements of the Sub-district Government;
b. elements of the sub-district police;
c. health service institutions;
d. community figures;
e. religious figures;
f. elements of community organizations.

text:
Pasal 29
LPPTK sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 28, mempunyai tugas: a. menerima pengaduan kasus kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak; b. memberikan konsultasi awal kepada korban kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak;
c. melakukan intervensi krisis terhadap korban kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak;
d. member! rujukan penanganan kasus kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak kepada PPT PKBGA.

translated_text:
Article 29
LPPTK as referred to in Article 28, has the duties of: a. receiving complaints of cases of gender-based violence and violence against children; b. providing initial consultation to victims of gender-based violence and violence against children;
c. conducting crisis intervention for victims of gender-based violence and violence against children;
d. providing referrals for handling cases of gender-based violence and violence against children to PPT PKBGA.

text:
Pasal 32
(1) Setiap korban kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak berhak: a. memperoleh perlindungan atas kemanan pribadi, keluarga dan harta bendanya, serta bebas dari ancaman yang berkenaan dengan keterangan yang akan, sedang, atau telah diberikan; b. untuk ikut serta dalam proses memilih dan menentukan bentuk perlindungan dan dukungan keamanan;
c. bebas dari pertanyaan yang menjerat;
d. mendapatkan informasi mengenai perkembangan kasus dan putusan pengadilan;
e. mendapatkan layanan pengaduan, layanan kesehatan, layanan rehabilitasi sosial, layanan bantuan dan penegakan hukum, serta layanan pemulangan dan reintegrasi sosial.
(2) Hak korban sebagimana dimaksud pada ayat (1) dilaksanakan sesuai dengan ketentuan peraturan perundang-undangan.

translated_text:
Article 32
(1) Every victim of gender-based violence and children has the right to: a. obtain protection for personal, family and property security, and freedom from threats related to testimony that will be, is being, or has been given; b. participate in the process of selecting and determining the form of protection and security support;
c. freedom from ensnaring questions;
d. obtain information regarding case developments and court decisions;
e. obtain complaint services, health services, social rehabilitation services, legal aid and enforcement services, as well as repatriation and social reintegration services.
(2) The rights of victims as referred to in paragraph (1) shall be implemented in accordance with the provisions of laws and regulations.

text:
BAB VIII
PERAN SERTA MASYARAKAT
Pasal 36
(1) Masyarakat dapat berperan serta dalam membantu upaya pencegahan dan penanganan korban kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak.
(2) Peran serta masyarakat sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1) berupa: a. memberikan informasi dan atau melaporkan setiap kekerasan yang diketahuinya;
b. memberikan perlindungan bagi korban;
c. memberikan pertolongan darurat;T 17
d. memberikan advokasi terhadap korban dan atau masyarakat tentang penanganan kekerasan berbasis gender dan anak;
e. membantu proses pengajuan permohonan penetapan perlindungan; f. membantu dalam proses pemulangan dan reintegrasi sosial.
(3) Peran serta masyarakat sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1) dapat dilakukan oleh perorangan, lembaga sosial kemasyarakatan, lembaga swadaya masyarakat, lembaga pendidikan, lembaga keagamaan, swasta, dan media massa.

